            "title": "Question: Position",
            "id": 77845,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>else</code> ifadesi, <code>if</code> ifadesinden sonra gelmelidir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code> ifadesinin bir koşulu olmalıdır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>else</code> ifadesi, <code>if</code> ifadesinden sonra gelmelidir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>is_weekend</code>, <code>False</code> iken <code>rise and shine</code> yedek seçenek olsun. Hangi değişiklik kodu geçerli kılar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>else</code> dalını <code>if</code> dalından sonra taşı.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code> sonrasına bir koşul ekle.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code> ifadesini <code>if</code> kod bloğunun içine girintile.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>else</code> dalını <code>if</code> dalından sonra taşı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
