          {
            "title": "Question: No own condition",
            "id": 77841,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>else</code> ifadesinin neden kendi koşulu yok?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Koşulu, <code>if</code> ifadesinin koşulunun tersi olduğu için</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Her zaman çalıştığı için bir koşula ihtiyaç duymaz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code> ifadesinin bir koşulu vardır </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koşulu, <code>if</code> ifadesinin koşulunun tersi olduğu için.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir program güneş gözlüğü öneren <code>else</code> dalından önce <code>if raining</code> kontrolü yapıyor. Yedek dal ne zaman çalışır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raining</code>, <code>False</code> olduğunda</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>raining</code>, <code>True</code> olduğunda</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code> yazılı bir koşula sahip olmadığı için her zaman</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raining</code>, <code>False</code> olduğunda öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Catch all",
            "id": 77840,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>common_friends</code> 3'ten küçük bir değere sahip olduğunda ne olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>else</code> ifadesinin kod bloğu çalışır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>if</code> ifadesinin kod bloğu çalışır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ne <code>if</code> bloğundaki ne de <code>else</code> ifadesinin kod bloğundaki kod çalışır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>else</code> ifadesinin kod bloğu çalışır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>common_friends</code> hangi değerlerinde <code>Friend suggestions: Sue</code> yazdırılır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code> ve ondan büyük her sayı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>'ten büyük her sayı, ama <code>3</code>'ün kendisi değil</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>'ten küçük her sayı</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> ve ondan büyük her sayı öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Lights on",
            "id": 77855,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>else</code> bloğunun çalışması için <code>mad_meter</code> için bir değer seç.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>79</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>mad_meter</code> kontrolünü ayarla ve koşulun <strong>sağlanmaması</strong> için değerini seç. Böylece kod <code>Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>79</code>, ardından <code>&gt;=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
