          {
            "title": "Question: Adding elif",
            "id": 78075,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperature = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brr...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's freezing!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's cold out.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's cold out.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>It's cold out.</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>It's freezing!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Brr...</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>It's cold out.</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>temperature</code> değişkeninin hangi değeri bu kodun <code>It's freezing!</code> görüntülemesini sağlar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperature = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brr...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's freezing!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's cold out.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's cold out.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78079,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>print(\"My favorite color!\")</code> ifadesinin girintisi, ilk <code>if</code> bloğunda ikinciye kıyasla farklıdır.</p><p>Bu kod bir <code>IndentationError</code> hatasına neden oluyor. Buna hangi <code>if</code> bloğu yol açıyor?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blue is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Green is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(&quot;My favorite color!&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                               ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"blue\"</code> bloğunun girintisi, diğer <code>print()</code> ve <code>if</code> ifadesinden farklı olduğu için bilgisayar bunun nereye ait olduğunu anlamaz.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"green\"</code> bloğu; ikinci <code>print()</code>, <code>if</code> anahtar sözcüğüyle aynı girinti düzeyinde olduğu için</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İkisi de</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"blue\"</code> bloğunun girintisi, diğer <code>print()</code> ve <code>if</code> ifadesinden farklı olduğu için bilgisayar bunun nereye ait olduğunu anlamaz..</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca <code>\"blue\"</code> dalındaki <code>print(\"My favorite color!\")</code> satırını düzenleyebilirsin.</p><p>Hangi değişiklik hatayı düzeltir ve satırı dalın içinde tutar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blue is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Green is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(&quot;My favorite color!&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                               ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code> ile eşleşecek şekilde girintile.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>if</code> satırıyla hizalamak için sola taşı.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code> satırından daha fazla girintile.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code> ile eşleşecek şekilde girintile.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>hours</code> değeri <code>5</code>'ten büyükse çalışacak başka bir <code>elif</code> deyimi ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hours = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Occasional app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moderate app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frequent app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moderate app use\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>hours &gt; 5</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>hours</code>, <code>5</code>'ten büyükken çalışan son bir dal ekle. Böylece bu çalıştırma <code>Frequent app use</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Occasional app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moderate app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frequent app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hours &gt; 7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Frequent app use\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>hours &gt; 5</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
