            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>elif</code> ifadesi için anahtar kelimeyi kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"email = \" /><text value=\"&quot;lori@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" email == \" /><text value=\"&quot;lori@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome, Lori.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" email == \" /><text value=\"&quot;brad@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, Brad...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"85\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Welcome, Lori.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>elif</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
