            "id": 80483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda kaç alternatif koşul birbirine bağlanmış?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Üç</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Alternatif koşul yoktur; hepsi <code>True</code> olmalıdır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Üç öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>got_recommendation</code> değerinin <code>False</code> olarak değiştiğini varsay. Değiştirilen kod ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>like_genre</code>, <code>True</code> olduğu için yine <code>Buy book</code> görüntüler.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir koşul <code>False</code> olduğu için hiçbir şey görüntülemez.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İlk koşul <code>False</code> olduğu için hiçbir şey görüntülemez.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>like_genre</code>, <code>True</code> olduğu için yine <code>Buy book</code> görüntüler.</p></body></html>"
